{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1000_p", "source_sha256": "040305d8a320012787c308a327794b0d509dbcf611e39ecaeca320907bdb41eb", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画のコラボで、子ども向け番組に\n出演する。猫に扮した琴葉は進行のサポート役だ）", "zh": "（作为角色扮演写真企划的合作项目，她将出演儿童节目。扮成猫咪的琴叶负责协助节目进行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e75848398165d51d4a8cc527fb929c7f9a1f0861ed6d6cd5ac1e28f877ae38aa", "ja": "お疲れ様、琴葉。\n熱心に台本を読んでるけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。\n看你正认真地读台本，没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "ef6a0384a70ec4832b31a256a24565352ccab63f2c44c2e2d95ad372151b92aa", "ja": "はい。私の台詞は、「ニャ～ン」や「ニャオン」\nみたいな猫の鳴き声がほとんどですから。", "zh": "是的。我的台词大多是“喵～”或者“喵呜”之类的猫叫声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "60cec2a25584217ca691ae0154316d0ca812825378550f343e05010d2780ee12", "ja": "編集で字幕が追加されると聞いていますが、収録中は\n字幕もありませんし、台本も確認できませんから。", "zh": "听说会通过后期剪辑加上字幕，不过录制时既没有字幕，也无法确认台本，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ee5d8d88c3fcb9e9317341c7ab7e49ddd4f50ff84981652a15b5ccb9ad30a010", "ja": "そうだよな。まあ、アドリブも大丈夫みたいだし、\nそう気負わずにな。", "zh": "是啊。听说即兴发挥也没问题，所以别太紧张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "adb043486dfc678e69d3d09060e117ff1335dc9a517ad4a47fd7c5e370ea04af", "ja": "そうですよね。でも……特徴のある役だからこそ、\n表現力を求められている気がするんです。", "zh": "是这样没错。不过……正因为是个很有特色的角色，我觉得才更需要表现力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "fe5a50839a6a191b88a517b8c1945af453ca420a9d2a2ff5546f1a2c05eccc48", "ja": "同じ台詞でも、怒ってる時と楽しい時では\n言い方……いいえ、言葉に乗せる感情が違いますよね？", "zh": "即使是同一句台词，生气的时候和开心的时候，\n说法……不对，寄托在话语里的感情也是不一样的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "52f6aa52e7f04d2ca43d15cbcdb50312cf4eea927e35ba9ce56e029f4951fa2a", "ja": "シンプルな鳴き声にどこまで感情を込められるかで、\n見てる人の印象も変わってくると思うんです。", "zh": "能在简单的叫声中融入多少感情，也会改变观看者的感受，我觉得是这样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1008_p", "source_sha256": "991c65d25ec4c3e52b1648cf30837dc1ba60eee2d21a29f2a68931a5c0c0d54e", "ja": "確かに。サポート役だから、わかりやすさも必要だ。\n……なるほど。演技者として、火がついたってとこか。", "zh": "确实。因为是配角，所以也需要让人一目了然。\n……原来如此。作为演员，是被点燃了斗志呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "b9f59a7731dce892d10bf3bca6e49c37498df33be9aa5ed93f7024c47de57b0f", "ja": "そんな大げさな……。でも、\nチャレンジしてみたいです。例えばこの台詞……。", "zh": "没那么夸张啦……不过，我想挑战一下。比如这句台词……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2e3d98d93782fa5581221ad2cd061ee50e83c30d4758bc358735ab1dba1a0740", "ja": "えっと……「みんなは、トマトが語る宇宙の真理って\n興味ある？」って台詞か。これをネコ語で？", "zh": "呃……“大家对番茄讲述的宇宙真理感兴趣吗？”这句台词吗？要用猫语来说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "326a44c19976a14d8c3b6fb2f6e28a9690d58697833e63e0a6e3176620c5c0d2", "ja": "はい。すみませんが、{$P$}。\nやってみるので、見てもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "好的。不用在意，{$P$}先生。  \n我试试看，您可以帮我看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6d072ff7486b7267883d721bada8c61e9a8c1199fa368e6b981666542a6e4f32", "ja": "ああ、構わないよ。", "zh": "啊，没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "332e34eb84323d63d11fb9701df0a179c655975068be469f169d036ea65247b6", "ja": "「ニャンニャニャ、ニャニャオン……\nニャニャ、ニャニャーニャ……ニャオ～ン？」", "zh": "“喵喵喵，喵喵喵呜……\n喵喵，喵喵～喵……喵呜～？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "e22cf07f677736c867a5d8f45d6b5e9c76a341ba510bb8718e0ef49a818a8521", "ja": "どうでしょうか？　トマトが語る宇宙の真理について、\n子ども達に興味を持ってもらえると思いますか？", "zh": "怎么样？关于番茄所讲述的宇宙真理，你觉得能让孩子们产生兴趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0edd6733e4369461b6a512161d8e54788bafa5dd7e1968f64043ed2f0ce405da", "ja": "……いや、なんかもう意味がどうとか以前に\nすごく可愛かったから、いいんじゃないか。うん。", "zh": "……不，怎么说呢，先不论有没有什么意义，\n因为实在太可爱了，所以应该没问题吧。嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "d34d3c20b55c99629ecfaea399db968bba7c7f2f9a2be08366eb04aa120685fa", "ja": "えっ、かわ……！？ ……コホン。", "zh": "诶，可爱……！？……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "521881ff9fe4dc33f0c90dee54834c06d04cbed63e0845fe360beb454cae100b", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\nそれじゃあ、この方向でやってみます。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}。\n那么，我就按这个方向试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0623_1019_p", "source_sha256": "95d472260e89a4a0dde76d9a736771fbd4407b83e34bd7c654ac8551905883b7", "ja": "（その後、愛らしい仕草と表現豊かなネコ語が\n話題になり、琴葉の猫のサポート役は評判になった！）", "zh": "（之后，她可爱的动作和表现力十足的猫语成了热门话题，琴叶的猫咪辅助角色也大受好评！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
